awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HKEPC\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HKEPC Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS TUF Gaming RTX 4070 can maintain a low fan speed under full load, and the temperature is below 60°C, so most of the test data is higher than other RTX 4070 samples, but it is also more expensive than other cards. If you are the pursuit of extreme heat dissipation, quiet operation of the player, and do not mind how much less, this card will be your choice.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>01/18/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4070 SUPER 12GB GDDR6X OC Edition Media review Award of HKEPC Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"ASUS\tVGA\tTUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER OC\t2024/1/18\tOnline Magazine\tHKEPC\t3.15 Slot !! SUPER 大升級\tSingle Exposure\tGood\tASUS TUF Gaming RTX 4070 OC 顯示卡是手上另一的 3 Slot+ 樣本，在完全負載下風扇仍能維持在低轉速，並且溫度低於 60°C，因此大部份測試數據均較其他 RTX 4070 樣本高，不過價錢亦相較其他卡昂貴，如果你是追求極致散熱、靜音運作的玩家，又不介意畀多少少，這張卡會是你的不二之選。\tY\tHKEPC Editor's Choice\thttps://www.hkepc.com/22018/3.15_Slot__SUPER_%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%87%E7%B4%9A_TUF_Gaming_GeForce_RTX_4070_SUPER_OC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"Produ